<title>USA: Park-Ohio president, COO Murray resigns.</title>
<headline>Park-Ohio president, COO Murray resigns.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>John Murray has resigned as president and chief operating officer of Park-Ohio Industries Inc to pursue other interests, the company said Friday.</p>
<p>Murray, who joined the company in June 1992, will still work as a consultant for Park-Ohio, it said.</p>
<p>Park-Ohio, a diversified manufacturing and logistics company, said they would not be replacing Murray at present.</p>
</text>
